   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>The source of the files is explained in the document: <a href=\"ftp://ftp.jax.org/MUGA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ftp://ftp.jax.org/MUGA</a></div><div>I believe the physical positions are mm10, but I&#39;m not positive.</div><div><br></div><div>The readme file there says <br></div><div>&quot;Thanks to Andrew Morgan of UNC for providing the marker locations at:&quot;<br></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://csbio.unc.edu/MUGA/snps.muga.Rdata\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://csbio.unc.edu/MUGA/snps.muga.Rdata&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483697505000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2wqK6vbYCvH63eCo5PSbhc\">http://csbio.unc.edu/MUGA/snps.muga.Rdata</a><br><a href=\"http://csbio.unc.edu/MUGA/snps.megamuga.Rdata\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://csbio.unc.edu/MUGA/snps.megamuga.Rdata&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483697505000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2g_Et7zL8ip2S1-CHVRsAl\">http://csbio.unc.edu/MUGA/snps.megamuga.Rdata</a><br><a href=\"http://csbio.unc.edu/MUGA/snps.gigamuga.Rdata\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://csbio.unc.edu/MUGA/snps.gigamuga.Rdata&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483697505000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2oZD1oNqmBrIKxJIQLdcCS\">http://csbio.unc.edu/MUGA/snps.gigamuga.Rdata</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>If you go to <a href=\"http://csbio.unc.edu/MUGA/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://csbio.unc.edu/MUGA/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483697505000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3NkwcJkZWViNwN0sX1OQo5\">http://csbio.unc.edu/MUGA/</a> there&#39;s a table that suggests that the muga and megamuga locations are in mm9 and the gigamuga locations are mm10.<br></div><div><br></div><div>karl<br></div>"
    ],
